### Get all
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

### Get by id (ใส่ uuid จริงจากฐาน)
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/1d6b1f4a-9e2f-4b2a-8a9a-3a3b8b6f2b9c

### Create (ต้องไม่ซ้ำ username/mobile/cardId)
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "12345678",
  "mobile": "0841234567",
  "cardId": "1122334455667"
}
